From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 13:43:07 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 230/297] Meridian: the tab on air is marked and can move;
 Boost colours turn the accent; 0.6.26

During a call the shared tab wears a ring and a monitor, and a monitor on
another tab moves the share there. A Boost colour now turns the site's own
accent to the picked hue instead of laying a filter over the whole page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
